  "summary": "仕様・設計文書にfrontmatter等で status/version/対象system version/作成日/出典/owner/再確認trigger を付け、失効文書はsupersededとして削除または隔離する。",
  "remedy_type": "structural-decision",
  "maturity": "candidate",
  "status": "active",
  "evidence": [
    {
      "kind": "local-mitigation-card",
      "reference": "MITIGATION-agent-configuration-drift-ownership-metadata",
      "observed_at": "2026-08-11",
      "summary": "reason・owner・対象version・失敗例・review triggerをfrontmatter/inventoryで持つ。candidate/medium。'metadataだけ更新する形骸化'が失敗条件。",
      "quality": "medium"
    },
    {
      "kind": "official-guidance",
      "reference": "https://google.github.io/styleguide/docguide/best_practices.html",
      "observed_at": "2026-08-15",
      "summary": "'Delete Dead Documentation': 陳腐化docは開発者を誤導し保守放置の前例を作るので体系的に削除。'Update Docs with Code': codeと同じCLで更新。",
      "quality": "high"
    },
    {
      "kind": "official-guidance",
      "reference": "https://adr.github.io/",
      "observed_at": "2026-08-15",
      "summary": "ADRはstatus(proposed/accepted/superseded)を持ち、過去決定は編集せず新ADRでsupersedeし決定logを保つ。",
      "quality": "medium"
    },
    {
      "kind": "official-guidance",
      "reference": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/github/spec-kit/main/templates/commands/clarify.md",
      "observed_at": "2026-08-15",
      "summary": "Spec Kit clarifyは'### Session YYYY-MM-DD'で日付付きに記録し、矛盾する旧記述は'replaced, not duplicated'。",
      "quality": "medium"
    }
  ],
  "applicability": {
